{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgLvFaJaXJn3ngZWVqrRs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to build 6 frames at 375×812 on the workspace page, and my first job is to settle a design system before any frame exists. I fix the palette from the assets: bg base #101014 (#0E0E12 also noted), surface 1 #1A1A20, surface 2 #22222A, border #2C2C36, text primary #F2F2F2, text secondary #9A9AA8, text tertiary #6B6B7A, brand #279646, gain #2ECC71 / #3DD68C, loss #FF5B5B, warning #FFB020. The text field fill 0.145,0.141,0.196 resolves to roughly #252432, so #252433 sits close enough for the field surface.\n\nThe fixed shell arithmetic settles the layout: status bar 44 + header 56 = 100, tab bar 66 + home indicator 34 = 100, so content height = 812 − 100 − 100 = 612. Each screen is a 375×812 vertical auto-layout frame with clip content, fill bg, spacing 0, and I set overflowDirection = \"VERTICAL\" on content areas that exceed 612 so scrolling exists where rows overflow.\n\nScreen 01 Aktivitas fits at 150 balance card + 36 section + 96 ticker strip + 36 section + 5 rows × 56 = 280, totaling 598. Screen 02 Trending overflows: 6 rows × 56 = 336 pushes past 612, so it scrolls. Screen 03 Detail scrolls and carries a fixed Jual / Beli action bar instead of a tab bar. Screen 04 Top Up Metode keeps the tab bar with Top Up current. Screen 05 Nominal totals 56 + 72 + 8 + 192 + 24 + 72 + 72 = 496, comfortably inside 612. Screen 06 Pembayaran has no tab bar and scrolls through the countdown 00:08:46, detail rows with copy icons, and 6 panduan steps.\n\nThe chart uses a VECTOR with vectorPaths from an SVG polyline over 6 points: 6:00 197, 10:00 199, 14:00 194, 18:00 196, 22:00 192, 2:00 189, across a 343×140 area with min 185 and max 202, plus a gradient area fill. The tooltip at 22:00 reads Rp192, 28 Okt 2022 - 22:00, Volume: 102K, in a 150×64 card above the point.\n\nFor reuse I load Rob",